  "description": {
   "en": "Going back to school and being just teacher and student...he hated the very idea of it.\n\nIt's a new school year, and even after being in a new class, Kurosawa Minato thought that things wouldn't really change...at least, that's how it was supposed to go.Minato's new homeroom teacher is perfect and popular, the type that Minato doesn't handle well. But Minato's every day begins to brim with color after learning of a different side to him.A line between \"teacher\" and \"student\" that must not be crossed.The special feelings that Minato harbors towards his \"teacher\" grow stronger,but how is Minato the \"student,\" reflected in Yoshioka's eyes?\n\nThis is the end of Kurosawa Minato's first love."
  },
